                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="602 1905 602 1920 2375 1913 2377 1898 2373 1868 1206 1859 1204 1859 1201 1859 1173 1872 907 1861 905 1861 903 1861 861 1872 822 1861 820 1861 818 1861 701 1872 617 1861 615 1861 612 1861 610 1861 599 1870 602 1905"/>
                        </Shape>
